          "author": "Jane Hissey",
          "description": "An enchanting treasury of teddy bear tales from Jane Hissey's beloved BAFTA award-winning Old Bear and Friends series! This beautifully narrated collection of classic children’s stories follows Old Bear, Duck, Rabbit, Little Bear and Bramwell Brown on a series of adorable adventures. Leave no bear behind as you hunt for a missing teddy, investigate a mysterious parcel, clamber to the attic to retrieve an old friend, and much more!",
